1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:03,640
(Amy:)I don't think that was
the point of the movie.

2
00:00:03,643 --> 00:00:05,113
(Sheldon:)Fine, then I was like Pinocchio

3
00:00:05,111 --> 00:00:08,711
(Sheldon:)before that jerk Geppetto
went and made him a real boy.

4
00:00:08,714 --> 00:00:10,914
(Amy:)There you go.

5
00:00:13,119 --> 00:00:14,789
(Penny:)So, what are you
thinking for dinner?

6
00:00:14,787 --> 00:00:15,887
(Leonard:)Well, it's Thai food night.

7
00:00:15,888 --> 00:00:16,988
(Penny:)Well, honey,

8
00:00:16,989 --> 00:00:18,319
(Penny:)you don't live
with Sheldon anymore.

9
00:00:18,324 --> 00:00:19,924
(Penny:)You can have anything you want.

10
00:00:19,926 --> 00:00:22,256
(Leonard:)You're right.

11
00:00:22,261 --> 00:00:23,631
(Leonard:)But what?

12
00:00:24,597 --> 00:00:25,667
(Leonard:)Mexican?

13
00:00:25,665 --> 00:00:27,065
(Leonard:)Italian? German?

14
00:00:27,066 --> 00:00:28,396
(Leonard:)Indian? Greek?

15
00:00:28,401 --> 00:00:29,631
(Leonard:)Cuban? Chinese?

16
00:00:29,635 --> 00:00:30,635
(Leonard:)Pizza? Barbecue?

17
00:00:30,636 --> 00:00:33,606
(Leonard:)Korean? Korean barbecue?

18
00:00:34,407 --> 00:00:35,577
(Penny:)How about Thai food?

19
00:00:35,575 --> 00:00:37,445
(Leonard:)Oh, thank God.

20
00:00:40,446 --> 00:00:42,676
(Penny:)Hey, we're going to dinner.
You want to come?

21
00:00:42,682 --> 00:00:44,352
(Sheldon:)Oh, I wish I could,

22
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:47,550
(Sheldon:)but I realized I've become
too emotionally vulnerable,

23
00:00:47,553 --> 00:00:49,553
(Sheldon:)so, like an operating system,

24
00:00:49,555 --> 00:00:52,655
(Sheldon:)I'm restoring my life
to the last stable version,

25
00:00:52,658 --> 00:00:55,998
(Sheldon:)which was in 2003,
the day before I met Leonard.

26
00:00:57,463 --> 00:00:59,263
(Leonard:)You heard him, no.

